%% PathMate.ai - Next Move sequence
%% Render: https://mermaid.live

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant Mock as mockNextMoveData
    participant API as POST personalized-next-move
    participant Chess as POST evaluate career-chess
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant OAI as OpenAI API

    User->>FE: Open /next-move page

    box Current UI flow
        Note over FE,Mock: Production UI uses local domain seed
        FE->>Mock: Load CareerTheme YearScenario EventCard
        Mock-->>FE: Static structures
        User->>FE: selectTheme and open CareerRunBoard
        FE->>FE: applyAction and resolveEvent in state
        FE-->>User: Board UX without API calls
    end

    box Backend API flow
        Note over FE,DB: Implemented server routes
        User->>FE: Trigger personalized board load
        FE->>Auth: getSession Bearer JWT
        FE->>API: POST /api/personalized-next-move language
        API->>Auth: getUserIdFromRequest
        API->>DB: profiles.select
        API->>API: fallback moveCandidates recommendedMove

        alt OpenAI configured
            API->>OAI: responses.create gpt-4.1-mini
            OAI-->>API: Personalized board JSON
            API->>API: Merge with fallback
        else No OpenAI
            API->>API: profile_fallback only
        end

        API->>DB: saveEvaluation career-chess
        API->>DB: career_simulations.insert
        API-->>FE: moveCandidates dailyMove evaluationId
        FE-->>User: Show AI roadmap
    end

    opt User submits deep strategy form
        User->>FE: Strategy inputs targetRole timeline
        FE->>Chess: POST /api/evaluate/career-chess
        Chess->>DB: getUserProfile
        Chess->>Chess: findCareerTemplate
        Chess->>OAI: requestEvaluationJson paths and ninetyDayPlan
        OAI-->>Chess: Strategy analysis JSON
        Chess->>DB: user_evaluations and career_simulations
        Chess-->>FE: paths recommendedPath skillGaps
        FE-->>User: Show strategy paths
    end
